{
 "_doc": "Saturday dances at the Vaults hall (docs/dances.md): asking a partner (a duel: read her and choose the way to ask), the ladies' choice at 22 (a rally: she leads), the floor's words outside the dances and at the watchman's 23:00, the poster in the lobby, the bar's talk, the partners' stamps and their reward, the quest dnc_white_dance. The partners are real residents under names of our own keys (city.dnc.p.*) so that a dance goes round town as the rumour kind 'dance', not 'beat'. The townsfolk who come are tools/town/town_dances.py's.",
